    "reason": "The claim that a causal attention mask is constructed as a binary matrix where entries for later positions are set to zero is supported by general knowledge (text_1) and the operational description in text_2. The qualifier 'where entries for later positions are set to zero' precisely defines the mechanism without contradicting the chapter's context.",
